### <ins> Basic setup </ins>
In its most basic setup the **PndPidCorrelator** only needs to be passed the names of the barrel and forward track branch to function properly. The default constructor *PndPidCorrelator()* initiates all **DetectorInfo** classes in their default version.  

```c++
PndMasterRunAna *fRun = new PndMasterRunAna();
FairGeane *Geane = new FairGeane(); // need Geane for default version
fRun->AddTask(Geane);

// default version of PndPidCorrelator uses default detector setup
PndPidCorrelator *corr = new PndPidCorrelator();
// add tracking detectors in barrel spectromenter
corr->SetBarrelTrackBranch("SttMvdGemGenTrack");
// add tracking detectors in forward spectromenter
corr->SetForwardTrackBranch("FtsIdealGenTrack");

fRun->AddTask(corr);
```

